{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-133","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817000-line","text":"你身处密林的深处，眼前是一座藤蔓攀援的古代神殿。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817001-line","text":"墨涅塔的金茧里生长出花束，雕像褪色为纯白，被蝴蝶环绕的诗人们，倾倒身体躺在石阶边缘，撩拨手中的琴弦。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817002-line","text":"「我聆听你的悲伤，西风的尽头，如溪流般交织的泪水。我歌咏你的爱情，在那斯缇科西亚的海畔。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817003-line","text":"他们的目光从你的发梢滑落，待到你重新睁开眼睛，身前唯余数只羽翼斑斓的蝴蝶。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817004-line","text":"「我要去追逐它们。」你的内心因渴望而发出呼喊","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-2096111672903299070-choice","text":"追逐嗅探旧事的蝴蝶。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-1148380481922824363-effect","text":"获得的奇物将与【事件】区域有关","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817005-line","text":"它赞美一缕金丝的纺织，蜕去旧身的神明，踏上遍寻爱意的旅程。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-11465773226877759551-choice","text":"追逐飞过战场的蝴蝶。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-8571242971217914789-effect","text":"获得的奇物将与【战斗】区域有关","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817007-line","text":"它哀悼一位悬锋国王的坠亡，英勇却傲慢的战士，被敌人的战车卷入轮底。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-6110668566900865085-choice","text":"追逐英雄肩上的蝴蝶。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-2083792275335466481-effect","text":"获得的奇物将与【遭遇】区域有关","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817009-line","text":"它呢喃一杯蜜酿的回味，追逐荣耀的英雄们，在飘摇的海上举杯对饮。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-7972084238944256417-choice","text":"追逐不期而遇的蝴蝶。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-text-2198678552502820533-effect","text":"获得的奇物将与【财富】区域有关","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-133-talk-403817016-line","text":"它等待一场永不再来的重逢，黄金璀璨的时节，诗人邂逅了黄金之茧的眷属。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"}]}
